  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutIncorporationOfTheRespondentDescription id="f-4" contextRef="c-1">Northern Border Pipeline Company is not incorporated, but is a Partnership. The Partnership was formed on March 9, 1978 in the state of Texas pursuant to the Texas Uniform Partnership Act.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutIncorporationOfTheRespondentDescription>
