  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-6" contextRef="c-1">The respondent was engaged in the transportation of natural gas through the states of Montana, North Dakota, South Dakota, Minnesota, Iowa, Illinois, and Indiana.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
